1. Charismatic ✨
Meaning: Naturally attractive and able to influence people.
Tamil: கவர்ச்சியான / பிறரை ஈர்க்கக்கூடிய
Synonyms: Charming, Magnetic, Captivating
Antonyms: Unappealing, Uninspiring
🧠 Trick: Charisma = charm that attracts people.

2. Convivial 🥳
Meaning: Friendly, cheerful, and sociable.
Tamil: நட்பான / மகிழ்ச்சியான
Synonyms: Sociable, Jovial, Friendly
Antonyms: Unfriendly, Aloof
🧠 Trick: Convivial → Come + lively → lively with people.
3. Altruistic ❤️
Meaning: Caring about others and helping them without expecting anything in return.
Tamil: தன்னலமற்ற
Synonyms: Selfless, Benevolent, Generous
Antonyms: Selfish, Self-centered
🧠 Trick: Altruistic = All for others.
4. Assertive 💪
Meaning: Confidently expressing your opinions or needs without being aggressive.
Tamil: தன்னம்பிக்கையுடன் கருத்தை வெளிப்படுத்துபவர்
Synonyms: Confident, Firm, Self-assured
Antonyms: Passive, Submissive
🧠 Trick: Assert = State your point firmly.
5. Amiable 😊
Meaning: Friendly and pleasant.
Tamil: இனிமையான / நட்பான
Synonyms: Friendly, Affable, Pleasant
Antonyms: Hostile, Unfriendly
🧠 Trick: Amiable → Amigo → friendly friend.
6. Aloof 🧊
Meaning: Emotionally distant; not very friendly or involved.
Tamil: விலகி இருப்பவர் / அக்கறையற்றவர்
Synonyms: Distant, Detached, Reserved
Antonyms: Warm, Friendly
🧠 Trick: Aloof = Away from people.
7. Impulsive ⚡
Meaning: Acting suddenly without thinking about the consequences.
Tamil: யோசிக்காமல் திடீரென செயல்படுபவர்
Synonyms: Spontaneous, Rash, Hasty
Antonyms: Cautious, Deliberate
🧠 Trick: Impulse → sudden action.
8. Stoic 🗿
Meaning: Remaining calm and not showing emotions, especially during difficulty.
Tamil: கஷ்டத்திலும் உணர்ச்சிகளை கட்டுப்படுத்துபவர்
Synonyms: Unemotional, Composed, Resilient
Antonyms: Emotional, Sensitive
🧠 Trick: Stoic = Stone-like calm.
9. Obstinate 🐐
Meaning: Stubborn; refusing to change your opinion or behaviour.
Tamil: பிடிவாதமான
Synonyms: Stubborn, Headstrong, Inflexible
Antonyms: Flexible, Compliant
🧠 Trick: Think of a stubborn goat refusing to move. 🐐
10. Gregarious 🗣️
Meaning: Very sociable and enjoying the company of others.
Tamil: சமூகமாக பழக விரும்புபவர்
Synonyms: Sociable, Outgoing, Convivial
Antonyms: Reclusive, Introverted
🧠 Trick: Gregarious = Group person.
